 "sentences": [
  "Allies hunted Nazi nukes behind enemy lines.",
  "The Alsos Mission tracked German nuclear technology progress during WWII.",
  "Their team included British and American scientific and military intelligence personnel.",
  "They raced to seize uranium and research before the Soviet Union could.",
  "They also investigated secret chemical and biological weapon sites.",
  "Even the famous V-2 rocket program became a target for intelligence gathering."
